# Changes by BurN-30 (2026-11-06, this file as a whole is GPL-3.0 with the pack):
# - a solo catch-up for a player behind the group, Loch Modan only: the Stormwind
#   errands (1338, 353, 92750, 92751, 97237, 97234), the mage quests (1920-1941), the
#   shaman Call of Fire (done in the Dwarf start), Ironband's escort chain (302, 273,
#   454, 309), Bingles (2039, 2038: breadcrumb from Ironforge, back and forth across the
#   loch), the level 16-18 quests (217, 297, 86613, 250, 199, 161) and the Dwarf/Gnome
#   flight errand's last leg (6392, back to Thelsamar) are left out;
# - Banner of the Fallen (86585) is left out: its giver and target are in no Forever
#   source but Lodestar's beta conversion;
# - route reordered (tower, Thelsamar, snow, troggs, the north, the east, Thelsamar),
#   steps named, tips rewritten, group notes added, a non-leveling category so Polestar
#   never opens it by itself;
# - every quest checked against Polestar's Forever data (data-v2026.11.1) and RestedXP's
#   free Forever guides (live, 06/11/2026): see the README. Snowbound's two NPCs and the
#   snowy patch, Daggerfang and the fishing toolbox have no position in Polestar's data:
#   their places come from Lodestar and RestedXP's guides (marked "?" in Reliability.lua).
guide groupe-alliance/13-solo-loch-modan
title Solo · Loch Modan
folder Group Alliance
category Miscellaneous
faction Alliance
levels 14-16
zone Loch Modan

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The southern guard tower

step The southern guard tower
  tip From Ironforge, follow the road east across Dun Morogh to the South Gate Pass tunnel; the guard tower stands where it opens onto Loch Modan.
  note Solo catch-up for a player behind the group. Back within 4 levels of the lowest player? Stop and rejoin: /polestar guides, Group Alliance, the group's guide.
  accept 224                                  -- Mountaineer Cobbleflint
  accept 267                                  -- Captain Rugelfuss

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thelsamar

step Thelsamar
  tip North along the road to the town. Mountaineer Kadrell walks up and down the road through town; Vidra Hearthstove and Grenhild Darktalon stand in the middle of town, Brock Stoneseeker on the east side, the gryphon master at the south end.
  getfp "Thelsamar"
  accept 416                                  -- Mountaineer Kadrell
  accept 1339                                 -- Mountaineer Kadrell
  accept 418                                  -- Vidra Hearthstove
  accept 86667 npc 49808 @36.6,48.3           -- Grenhild Darktalon
  accept 6387 only Dwarf,Gnome                -- Brock Stoneseeker
  turnin 6387 only Dwarf,Gnome                -- Thorgrum Borrelson, the gryphon master
  accept 6391 only Dwarf,Gnome                -- Handed in at the end, in Ironforge

step Sausages on the way
  along until q418
  tip Boars, black bears and Forest Lurkers (spiders) roam the hills west of the road, between the tunnel and the Silver Stream Mine.
  collect 3172 quest 418.1                    -- Boar Intestines
  collect 3173 quest 418.2                    -- Bear Meat
  collect 3174 quest 418.3                    -- Spider Ichor

step The snowy patch
  tip Back south along the road, almost to the tunnel: use the Ceramic Jar Grenhild gave you while standing on the patch of snow.
  collect 279379 quest 86667.1 @19.6,63.1     -- Jar of Snow

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stonesplinter Valley

step Stonesplinter Valley
  tip The troggs camp in the valley east of the tower. Every trogg can drop a Stone Tooth: no need to hunt one kind.
  kill 1161 x10 quest 224.1                   -- Stonesplinter Troggs
  kill 1162 x10 quest 224.2                   -- Stonesplinter Scouts
  collect 2536 x8 quest 267.1                 -- Trogg Stone Teeth

step The southern guard tower
  turnin 224                                  -- Mountaineer Cobbleflint
  turnin 267                                  -- Captain Rugelfuss
  accept 237                                  -- Mountaineer Gravelgaw

step Deeper in the valley
  tip Further south, past the first camp, Skullthumpers and Seers (13-14) hold the valley's end.
  kill 1163 x10 quest 237.1                   -- Stonesplinter Skullthumpers
  kill 1166 x10 quest 237.2                   -- Stonesplinter Seers

step The southern guard tower
  turnin 237                                  -- Mountaineer Gravelgaw

step The valley's end
  when level>=15
  tip Level 15 or more: Mountaineer Wallbang wants the Shamans and Bonesnappers (15-16) at the very back of the valley. Under 15, skip it.
  accept 263                                  -- Mountaineer Wallbang
  kill 1197 x10 quest 263.1                   -- Stonesplinter Shamans
  kill 1164 x10 quest 263.2                   -- Stonesplinter Bonesnappers
  turnin 263                                  -- Mountaineer Wallbang

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step Silver Stream Mine
  zone Loch Modan
  tip North on the road past Thelsamar to the mine at the north-west end of the loch. Mountaineer Stormpike stands at its entrance.
  turnin 1339                                 -- Mountaineer Stormpike
  accept 307                                  -- Mountaineer Stormpike

step Rats and crates
  tip The Miners' League Crates sit inside the mine; Tunnel Rat kobolds fill it and the hills around it.
  collect 2640 x4 quest 307.1                 -- Miners' Gear, from the crates
  collect 3110 x12 quest 416.1                -- Tunnel Rat Ears

step Silver Stream Mine
  turnin 307                                  -- Mountaineer Stormpike

step Norric Lochthane
  tip His house stands on the north-west shore of the loch, east of the mine.
  turnin 86667 npc 258043 @41.8,19.0          -- Norric Lochthane

step Thelsamar
  label q418
  tip Back south along the road.
  turnin 416                                  -- Mountaineer Kadrell
  turnin 418                                  -- Vidra Hearthstove
  accept 436                                  -- Jern Hornhelm

step The fishing toolbox
  tip Optional, for swimmers: a Discarded Fishing Toolbox lies on the lake floor east of town, at one of several spots: swim until its "!" shows on the minimap. Young Threshadons (19-20) swim in the loch: keep clear.
  accept 86614 object 665289 optional @48.1,39.7

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The east

step Ironband's Excavation
  tip East along the road on the south shore. Magmar Fellhew and Prospector Ironband stand at the dig site; the troggs digging just east of them are 17-20: keep away.
  turnin 436                                  -- Magmar Fellhew
  accept 298                                  -- Prospector Ironband

step Farstrider Lodge
  tip The lodge stands at the east end of the loch. Daryl's quest has a 15-minute timer: the Mountain Buzzards fly over the hills west and south-west of the lodge.
  accept 257                                  -- Daryl the Youngling
  accept 385                                  -- Marek Ironheart
  accept 86758                                -- Marek Ironheart
  kill 1194 x6 quest 257.1                    -- Mountain Buzzards
  turnin 257                                  -- Daryl the Youngling

step A Hunter's Challenge
  when level>=15
  tip 12 minutes this time: Elder Mountain Boars (16-17) roam the hills north-west of the lodge. Under 15, or short on time, skip it.
  accept 258                                  -- Daryl the Youngling
  kill 1192 x5 quest 258.1                    -- Elder Mountain Boars
  turnin 258                                  -- Daryl the Youngling

step The loch shore
  tip Loch Crocolisks line the east and north shores. Daggerfang, the named one, swims along the east shore north-west of the lodge. Leave the Large Loch Crocolisk (level 22) alone.
  collect 2924 x5 quest 385.1                 -- Crocolisk Meat
  collect 2925 x6 quest 385.2                 -- Crocolisk Skins
  collect 279591 quest 86758.1 @62.8,46.8     -- Marek's Croc-Hunting Knife: Daggerfang

step Farstrider Lodge
  turnin 385                                  -- Marek Ironheart
  turnin 86758                                -- Marek Ironheart

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to Ironforge

step Thelsamar
  tip West along the road. Khara Deepwater sells fishing supplies by the water north-east of town.
  turnin 298                                  -- Jern Hornhelm
  accept 301                                  -- Jern Hornhelm
  turnin 86614 optional                       -- Khara Deepwater

step Fly to Ironforge
  fly "Ironforge"

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  tip Prospector Stormpike is in the Hall of Explorers; Golnir Bouldertoe in the Great Forge; Gryth Thurden is the gryphon master where you landed.
  note Back with the group: /polestar guides, Group Alliance, the group's guide.
  turnin 301                                  -- Prospector Stormpike
  turnin 6391 only Dwarf,Gnome                -- Golnir Bouldertoe
  accept 6388 only Dwarf,Gnome
  turnin 6388 only Dwarf,Gnome                -- Gryth Thurden
